    "id": "N10-009-C01-Q083",
    "chapterIndex": 0,
    "text": "Scenario: A multi-story office building experiences a sudden power surge that burns out the main distribution switch on the ground floor. Workstations on floors 2, 3, and 4 can still communicate with local servers on their own floors, but they can no longer reach any workstations on other floors or access the internet. What structural layout issue does this scenario demonstrate?",
