    "chapterIndex": 0,
    "text": "Scenario: A technician is instructed to install a new high-density server module into a live production rack. Before touching the module, he ensures that the rack enclosure is properly grounded to the building's electrical earth ground system. Why is this environmental grounding crucial for the safety of the network components?",
