    "text": "Scenario: A network administrator modifies a router's access control list at 2:00 PM on a busy workday. Immediately, half of the company's customer service agents lose access to their web applications. Realizing his error, the administrator reverts the change. According to the CompTIA troubleshooting methodology, what critical mistake did the administrator make during Step 4 (Plan of Action and Implementation)?",
