    "chapterIndex": 1,
    "text": "An internet service provider runs a high-speed link to an office. They install a network interface box inside the ground floor utility closet. Outside internet reaches this box perfectly, but the computers inside the office can't browse. The provider states, 'Our link is active up to the boundary box.' What point is the provider referring to?",
