    "id": "N10-009-C02-Q074",
    "chapterIndex": 1,
    "text": "Scenario: A junior technician is tasked with cleaning out an old storage closet filled with decommissioned network gear. He finds an old enterprise router, checks the inventory tag, and notices its lifecycle log has no entry for its decommissioning phase. Before throwing the device into a recycling bin, what critical data security procedure must he perform?",
