    "id": "N10-009-C02-Q075",
    "chapterIndex": 1,
    "text": "Scenario: An automated temperature monitor inside a remote server room in Abuja continuously tracks environmental states. Suddenly, a cooling unit fails, and the temperature rises past 40°C. The monitor uses SNMP to send an alert to the central IT station in Lagos. The IT station receives the alert, but the network engineer notes that the monitoring dashboard is displaying distorted data charts. Which software modification should the engineer execute to fix the dashboard software display error without altering the underlying OS settings?",
