    "text": "Scenario: A corporate user reports that their internet connection drops every time their office neighbor receives a phone call on an old landline system. A technician discovers that the data cable and the landline phone wire are pinned tightly together inside the same plastic trunking down the hallway, causing data frame errors. What specific cabling flaw is causing this drop?",
