    "id": "N10-009-C02-Q078",
    "chapterIndex": 1,
    "text": "Scenario: An engineering team is preparing to upgrade a company's main web server application. The change request is approved by the review board. During the implementation window, the upgrade encounters an unhandled exception error, rendering the website completely offline. The technician realizes the upgrade file is corrupted. What is the team's correct next operational step according to Change Management best practices?",
