    "chapterIndex": 10,
    "text": "A network administrator configures port security on a switch to only allow a desktop computer with a specific MAC address to connect. If an employee unplugged that computer and plugged in their personal laptop, what would happen if the port security is set to 'Shutdown' mode?",
